{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_ohThZYjfNHm8FuEjiVuLm5lN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"tool_I04kL5oChdkg658Vm8ILJV2L","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/data/cre/workspace/se3.0/.worktrees/verify-human-calls-archive/FINDINGS.md","content":"# Human Calls Archiving System Verification\n\n## Summary\n\nThe human calls archiving system is **fully functional**. All tests pass and manual CLI verification confirms the system works as expected.\n\n## Verification Results\n\n### 1. Archive Command (`se3 human-calls archive`)\n\n**Status: WORKING**\n\n- Archives completed/responded/expired calls to `human-calls/archive/`\n- Default behavior: archives calls completed > 30 days ago\n- `--dry-run` flag: Correctly previews what would be archived without moving files\n- `--days N` flag: Configurable age threshold for archiving\n- `--all-completed` flag: Archives all completed calls regardless of age\n- Handles filename collisions by appending counter (e.g., `file_1.md`)\n- Properly removes archived files from active tracking cache\n\n### 2. List Command (`se3 human-calls list`)\n\n**Status: WORKING**\n\n- `--status pending`: Lists only pending calls (awaiting response)\n- `--status responded`: Lists responded calls (waiting to be processed)\n- `--status completed`: Lists completed calls\n- `--status archived`: Lists archived calls with archive timestamp\n- `--status all`: Lists all active calls (default)\n- `--limit N`: Configurable maximum number of calls to show\n- Displays status icons (○ pending, ◉ responded, ● completed, etc.)\n- Shows creation and response timestamps\n\n### 3. Completed Calls Archiving\n\n**Status: WORKING**\n\nA call is considered \"completed\" when:\n- Status is `RESPONDED` or `COMPLETED`\n- Has a meaningful response (≥10 chars, not default prompt markers)\n- Response doesn't contain markers like `<!-- Human: write your response below -->`\n\nArchiving behavior verified:\n- Completed calls are moved from `human-calls/` to `human-calls/archive/`\n- Pending calls remain in the active directory\n- Archive directory is created automatically if it doesn't exist\n- File metadata is preserved during move\n\n## Test Results\n\n```\n============================= test session results =============================\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestArchiveDirectory::test_ensure_archive_dir_creates_directory PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestArchiveDirectory::test_ensure_archive_dir_existing PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_responded_status_is_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_completed_status_is_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_pending_status_not_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_meaningful_response_considered_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_default_prompt_response_not_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestIsCallCompleted::test_short_response_not_completed PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestGetCallsCounts::test_get_pending_calls_count PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestGetCallsCounts::test_get_pending_calls_count_empty PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestGetCallsCounts::test_get_pending_calls_count_no_directory PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestGetCallsCounts::test_get_responded_calls_count PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestArchiveCommandIntegration::test_archive_moves_completed_calls PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestArchiveCommandIntegration::test_archive_dry_run_does_not_move PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestArchiveCommandIntegration::test_archive_handles_filename_collision PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestListCommandIntegration::test_list_pending_calls PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestListCommandIntegration::test_list_archived_calls PASSED\ntests/test_human_calls_archive.py::TestListCommandIntegration::test_list_no_calls_directory PASSED\n\n============================== 18 passed ======================================\n```\n\nFull test suite: **219 passed, 5 warnings**\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `tools/se3_tools/commands/human_calls_cmd.py` - CLI commands\n- `tools/se3_tools/human_calls.py` - Core HumanCallStore class with archive logic\n- `tests/test_human_calls_archive.py` - Test coverage\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe human calls archiving system is fully operational and ready for production use.\n"}}],"model":"kimi-for-coding","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":58590,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","prompt_tokens":58590,"cached_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f63c24c-7ab6-4686-be8c-0640fbd6608e","uuid":"3541a99a-9c4b-4245-b5a9-7ad1b2c4c032"}
